836 < 1   }
837 < 1 
839 > 2   // `hub` is null for a pass that asked no hub — every pass but the `kata`
840 < 2   // rollback's — and for one told there is none; otherwise the host it asked
841 < 2   // and, when it could not, why — the first reason, kept whole.
838 < 2   // `hub` is null for a pass that was told there is no hub; otherwise the host
839 < 2   // it asked and, when it could not, why — the first reason, kept whole.
